康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":113.02,"default_fair_val":113.02,"premium_pct":-12.4,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":43.3,"pe_forward":38.1,"pb_trailing":3.2,"pb_forward":2.9,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":3.8,"fcf_to_ev":4.43,"fcf_to_mcap":6.62,"liab_to_assets":74,"cash_to_assets":0.5,"current_ratio":1.51,"roe":7.3,"roa":1.9,"moat":{"ticker":"PFGC","period":"2026Q4","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"PFGC 作為食品經銷商，其品牌價值主要體現在其服務的可靠性與廣泛的產品組合，而非消費者直接認知的品牌忠誠度。其定價能力受限於市場競爭，難以大幅超出同業水平。雖然其擁有自有品牌，但與頂級消費品牌相比，其品牌溢價空間有限。在食品分銷這個相對商品化的行業中，PFGC 的品牌定價權屬於中等水平，難以形成顯著的經濟壁壘。","comment_en":"PFGC, as a food distributor, derives its brand value primarily from the reliability of its services and its extensive product portfolio, rather than direct consumer brand loyalty. Its pricing power is constrained by market competition, making it difficult to significantly exceed industry peers. While it has private label brands, the premium pricing potential is limited compared to top-tier consumer brands. In the relatively commoditized food distribution sector, PFGC's brand pricing power is moderate, failing to form a significant economic moat."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"食品分銷行業的進入壁壘主要來自於規模、物流網絡和客戶關係，而非專利或特許經營權。PFGC 的業務模式不依賴於任何受專利保護的技術或獨特的監管許可。其營運需遵守食品安全、運輸等一般性法規，但這些並非構成其獨特的競爭優勢或經濟護城河。因此，在專利與監管壁壘方面，PFGC 的得分極低。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in the food distribution industry stem primarily from scale, logistics networks, and customer relationships, rather than patents or exclusive licenses. PFGC's business model does not rely on any patented technology or unique regulatory permits. Its operations are subject to general regulations like food safety and transportation, but these do not constitute a unique competitive advantage or economic moat. Consequently, PFGC scores very low on patent and regulatory barriers."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於 PFGC 的客戶（餐飲業者、零售商等）而言，更換食品供應商涉及相當高的轉換成本。這包括尋找新供應商、重新談判合約、調整採購流程、以及潛在的供應鏈中斷風險。PFGC 龐大的分銷網絡和產品多樣性，使其成為許多客戶的一站式解決方案，一旦客戶習慣了其服務的便利性和效率，轉換的麻煩和風險會促使他們維持現狀。這構成了較為堅固的轉換成本壁壘。","comment_en":"For PFGC's customers (restaurants, retailers, etc.), switching food suppliers involves considerable switching costs. This includes finding new suppliers, renegotiating contracts, adjusting procurement processes, and the potential risk of supply chain disruption. PFGC's vast distribution network and product diversity make it a one-stop solution for many clients. Once customers become accustomed to the convenience and efficiency of its services, the hassle and risk of switching encourage them to maintain the status quo. This constitutes a relatively strong switching cost barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"PFGC 的業務模式，即連接食品生產商與下游客戶，理論上存在一定的網絡效應：供應商越多，對客戶越有吸引力；客戶越多，對供應商越有吸引力。然而，在食品分銷領域，這種網絡效應相對較弱。供應商通常有多個分銷渠道，客戶也可能從多家經銷商採購。PFGC 的網絡效應並非指數級增長，難以形成像社交網絡或市場平台那樣的強大網絡效應壁壘。","comment_en":"PFGC's business model, connecting food producers with downstream customers, theoretically exhibits some network effects: more suppliers attract more customers, and more customers attract more suppliers. However, in the food distribution sector, these network effects are relatively weak. Suppliers often have multiple distribution channels, and customers may source from several distributors. PFGC's network effects do not grow exponentially, making it difficult to form a strong barrier like those seen in social networks or marketplaces."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"作為美國最大的食品經銷商之一，PFGC 享有顯著的規模經濟優勢。其龐大的採購量使其能夠從供應商處獲得更優惠的價格，並透過優化的物流網絡降低運輸成本。這種規模化的運營效率，包括倉儲、配送和庫存管理，是小型競爭對手難以企及的。這種成本優勢是其核心競爭力，構成了極為堅固的護城河。","comment_en":"As one of the largest food distributors in the United States, PFGC enjoys significant economies of scale. Its massive purchasing volume allows it to secure more favorable prices from suppliers and reduce transportation costs through an optimized logistics network. This scaled operational efficiency, encompassing warehousing, distribution, and inventory management, is difficult for smaller competitors to match. This cost advantage is its core competitive strength, forming a very strong moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"PFGC 的業務遍及美國，擁有廣泛的地理覆蓋和物流基礎設施。然而，這些資產雖然重要，但並非獨一無二或不可複製。其他大型食品經銷商同樣擁有廣泛的網絡，並且地理位置的優勢在高度互聯的現代物流體系中，其獨特性和持久性相對較弱。PFGC 的地理佈局是其競爭力的來源之一，但不足以構成獨特的經濟壁壘。","comment_en":"PFGC operates across the United States, possessing extensive geographic coverage and logistics infrastructure. However, while these assets are important, they are neither unique nor irreplicable. Other large food distributors also have extensive networks, and the advantage of geographic location is relatively weak in its uniqueness and durability within a highly interconnected modern logistics system. PFGC's geographic footprint is a source of its competitiveness, but it does not constitute a unique economic barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"PFGC 在食品分銷領域展現了卓越的營運效率。透過先進的物流技術、精準的庫存管理和優化的配送路線，公司能夠在保證產品新鮮度和及時交付的同時，有效控制成本。其高達 1,029.6 百萬美元的自由現金流（TTM）證明了其強勁的營運能力。這種持續的、高水平的營運效率，對於依賴精確度和成本控制的食品分銷行業而言，是一個堅實的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"PFGC demonstrates excellent operational efficiency in the food distribution sector. Through advanced logistics technology, precise inventory management, and optimized delivery routes, the company can effectively control costs while ensuring product freshness and timely delivery. Its strong free cash flow of $1,029.6 million (TTM) is a testament to its robust operational capabilities. This sustained, high level of operational efficiency represents a solid competitive advantage in the food distribution industry, which relies heavily on precision and cost control."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"PFGC 的資本配置策略顯示出一定的穩健性，其自由現金流充裕，能夠支持債務償還和潛在的再投資。然而，其 ROE 僅為 7.3%，ROA 為 1.9%，顯示其資本回報率並非特別突出。雖然公司在維持運營和擴張方面進行了合理配置，但相較於那些能持續產生超額回報的頂尖企業，其資本配置的卓越性還有提升空間，尚不足以構成強大的壁壘。","comment_en":"PFGC's capital allocation strategy shows some steadiness, with ample free cash flow to support debt repayment and potential reinvestment. However, its ROE of only 7.3% and ROA of 1.9% indicate that its capital return rates are not particularly outstanding. While the company has allocated capital reasonably for operations and expansion, there is room for improvement in capital allocation excellence compared to top companies that consistently generate excess returns, thus not yet forming a strong barrier."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"PFGC 的客戶留存率得益於其提供的全面服務和穩定的供應鏈。餐飲和零售客戶高度依賴可靠的食品供應，PFGC 透過其龐大的分銷網絡和多樣化的產品選擇，滿足了客戶的關鍵需求。一旦建立起穩固的合作關係，並克服了轉換成本（M3），客戶傾向於維持長期合作。這種基於可靠性、廣泛性及服務的客戶忠誠度，構成了較強的客戶留存壁壘。","comment_en":"PFGC's customer retention rate benefits from the comprehensive services and stable supply chain it provides. Foodservice and retail clients are highly dependent on reliable food supply, and PFGC meets these critical needs through its vast distribution network and diverse product selection. Once a solid working relationship is established and switching costs (M3) are overcome, customers tend to maintain long-term cooperation. This customer loyalty, based on reliability, breadth of offering, and service, forms a strong customer retention barrier."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"食品分銷是一個相對穩定的行業，人們對食物的需求是持久的。PFGC 作為行業領導者，其業務模式具有較強的抗顛覆性，不易被新興技術或商業模式迅速取代。儘管面臨來自線上平台和區域性經銷商的競爭，但其規模、網絡和運營效率提供了相當的韌性。只要能持續適應市場變化並保持效率，其商業模式的持久性較高。","comment_en":"Food distribution is a relatively stable industry, and the demand for food is enduring. As an industry leader, PFGC's business model possesses strong resilience against disruption and is not easily replaced by emerging technologies or business models. Despite competition from online platforms and regional distributors, its scale, network, and operational efficiency provide considerable resilience. As long as it can continuously adapt to market changes and maintain efficiency, the durability of its business model is high."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"PFGC 作為美國領先的食品經銷商，其核心競爭力來自於龐大的規模經濟（M5）和卓越的營運效率（M7），這構成了其最堅實的護城河。客戶因轉換成本（M3）和 PFGC 可靠的服務而具有較高的留存率（M9）。然而，其品牌定價權（M1）、網絡效應（M4）和地理資產（M6）的壁壘相對較弱，且資本配置（M8）的回報率有待提升。整體而言，PFGC 擁有一個穩固的、以規模和效率為基礎的「收費橋」式護城河，在可預見的未來，其在食品供應鏈中的關鍵角色將持續提供穩定性，但成長空間可能受限於行業特性。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"As a leading food distributor in the US, PFGC's core competitive strengths lie in its significant economies of scale (M5) and excellent operational efficiency (M7), forming its most robust moat. Customers exhibit high retention rates (M9) due to switching costs (M3) and PFGC's reliable services. However, barriers related to brand pricing power (M1), network effects (M4), and geographic assets (M6) are relatively weaker, and its capital allocation (M8) return rates need improvement. Overall, PFGC possesses a solid 'toll bridge'-like moat based on scale and efficiency. Its critical role in the food supply chain will continue to provide stability in the foreseeable future, although growth potential may be constrained by industry characteristics.","evidenceHash":"5f560e7e7b1ea2b9ad99968a78982200702ae459ef661c05b0c68fcf6f2cdcf0","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-27","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-30T17:41:00.606Z","evidenceHash":"aec129c031c29e9892ebaee60e9d0c60f59a27e5934780cf4b5ff2fb92502e4e"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-27","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-30T17:41:00.606Z","evidenceHash":"aec129c031c29e9892ebaee60e9d0c60f59a27e5934780cf4b5ff2fb92502e4e"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PFGC.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PFGC.png","website":"https://www.pfgc.com","ceo":"Scott E. McPherson","full_time_employees":"43780","description":"Performance Food Group Company, through its subsidiaries, engages in the marketing and distribution of food and food-related products in North America. It operates through three segments: Foodservice, Convenience, and Specialty. The company offers beef, pork, poultry, and seafood; frozen food and refrigerated products; dry groceries comprising cleaning and kitchen supplies and disposables; candy, snacks, and beverages; and fresh products, groceries, dairy, bread, beverages, general merchandise, and health and beauty care products, as well as cigarettes and other nicotine products. It also operates distribution centers. In addition, the company provides marketing programs and technology solutions to customer locations, as well as value-added services in the areas of product selection and procurement, menu development, and operational strategy. It serves individual restaurants, national and regional chain restaurants, vending distributors, theaters, retailers, and national, regional, and independent convenience stores. Performance Food Group Company was founded in 1885 and is headquartered in Richmond, Virginia.","description_en":"Performance Food Group Company, through its subsidiaries, engages in the marketing and distribution of food and food-related products in North America. It operates through three segments: Foodservice, Convenience, and Specialty. The company offers beef, pork, poultry, and seafood; frozen food and refrigerated products; dry groceries comprising cleaning and kitchen supplies and disposables; candy, snacks, and beverages; and fresh products, groceries, dairy, bread, beverages, general merchandise, and health and beauty care products, as well as cigarettes and other nicotine products. It also operates distribution centers. In addition, the company provides marketing programs and technology solutions to customer locations, as well as value-added services in the areas of product selection and procurement, menu development, and operational strategy. It serves individual restaurants, national and regional chain restaurants, vending distributors, theaters, retailers, and national, regional, and independent convenience stores. Performance Food Group Company was founded in 1885 and is headquartered in Richmond, Virginia.","description_zh":"**Performance Food Group Co. (PFGC) 業務營運精煉分析**\n\nPerformance Food Group Company (PFGC) 透過旗下子公司，專注於北美地區食品及相關產品的行銷與通路分銷。公司營運劃分為三大業務板塊：餐飲服務 (Foodservice)、便利商店 (Convenience) 及特殊品項 (Specialty)。\n\nPFGC 提供多元化的產品組合，涵蓋：牛肉、豬肉、禽肉、海鮮；冷凍及冷藏食品；乾貨，包括清潔用品、廚房耗材與一次性用品；糖果、零食與飲品；以及生鮮產品、雜貨、乳製品、麵包、飲品、一般商品、保健與美容護理產品，並包含香菸及其他尼古丁產品。此外，公司亦營運倉儲物流中心。\n\n在營運模式上，PFGC 不僅提供產品，更為客戶端提供行銷方案與技術解決方案，並在產品選擇、採購、菜單開發及營運策略等領域提供加值服務。其客戶群廣泛，包括獨立餐廳、連鎖餐飲品牌、自動販賣機經銷商、影院、零售商，以及全國性、區域性及獨立的便利商店。PFGC 成立於 1885 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州里奇蒙市。","address":"12500 West Creek Parkway","city":"Richmond","state":"VA","zip":"23238","country":"US","phone":"804 484 7700","full_address":"12500 West Creek Parkway, Richmond, VA 23238, US","range_52w":"80.82-117.48","year_high":117.48,"year_low":80.82,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":80.82,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"Grosh Chasity D","title":"officer: See Remarks","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":1005,"price":92.4,"total_val":0.09},{"date":"2026-09-29","name":"Grosh Chasity D","title":"officer: See Remarks","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":434,"price":91.97,"total_val":0.04},{"date":"2026-09-02","name":"Hatcher Hugh Patrick","title":"officer: See Remarks","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2900,"price":99.16,"total_val":0.29},{"date":"2026-09-02","name":"Hatcher Hugh Patrick","title":"officer: See Remarks","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":100,"price":99.75,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-08-25","name":"DAVIS ERIKA T","title"